    excerpt: "The Tesla Model Y is one of the most talked-about electric vehicles on the market, and it’s easy to see why. This sleek, powerful SUV offers cutting-edge technology, impressive performance, and a host of features that make it a great choice for anyone looking to make the switch to electric. However, as with any vehicle,",
